      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNSTABLE MABLE (4) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from six starts. Placed last time (19.72) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten a neck. Looks suited and should go close. NOAKI STAR (3) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (20.48) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Must be included in calculations. SURF SIZE QUEEN (1) was safely held in tougher company last start at this track, but prior to that won comfortably by 5.5 lengths at Q Straight (16.63) beating Let Me Go in a Grade 5 on August 3. Shapes as one to consider. MELISSA'S FLYING (2) is a last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
